  "description": "Instant Power Boost\nThe RetroVolt Pro packs a 2000W peak brushless motor with 99 N·m of torque, delivering the strength to dominate steep hills and rough terrain with ease. Paired with 20x4\" wide tires, it provides unbeatable traction and stability, whether you’re cruising city streets or exploring off-road trails. Experience explosive acceleration—going from 0 to 30 mph in just 5 seconds—and reach up to 38 mph with Pedal Assist, giving you thrilling speed with total control.\nEnjoy Longer Adventures\nUpgraded with a robust 1040Wh battery, the RetroVolt Pro is built to take you further than ever before. With a maximum range of up to 75 miles on a single charge, it’s perfect for long commutes, weekend cruises, or all-day adventures. Spend less time worrying about charging and more time enjoying the open road—freedom, power, and endurance all in one ride.\nPrecision Dual Suspension\nEquipped with a Horst-Link rear suspension and hydraulic front suspension, the RetroVolt Pro expertly absorbs shocks from rough roads, gravel, and uneven trails. This advanced system delivers buttery-smooth rides, ensuring rider comfort and stability while maintaining full handling precision across any terrain.\nUpdated Brake : All-weather Stopping Power\nThe RetroVolt Pro takes braking to the next level with its new hydraulic disc system. Delivering instant, reliable stopping power in any weather, the upgraded brakes provide riders with the confidence to push further. Engineered for smooth precision and total control, the RetroVolt Pro ensures every ride feels powerful, responsive, and secure.",
